        disclaimer. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
        KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.

    Rows are additionally placed by the editor itself rather than left to the
    terminal's autowrap, with the cursor hidden mid-frame, as in Python Prompt
    Toolkit by Jonathan Slenders (https://github.com/prompt-toolkit/
